00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I'm Dan Mistretta, Team Forced Futures.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Challenge 10: find places on Earth to test for the Moon and Mars.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
This is Umbra. Match the physics, not the scenery.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Real NASA lunar and Mars orbiter maps set 36 conditions. Umbra scores all of Earth for each one.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Drop in new data and it re-ranks live. It found ESA's Lanzarote lava tubes on its own.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Next: every Artemis and Mars team picks its field sites by the test it needs, from western Tibet to Eureka Sound.
